p><p>Dean W. Ball (@deanwball) on X</p><p>Every use case of manus in the company’s demo video would be an enormous liability and regulatory risk for American companies (under current law! No sb 1047 required!), particularly given the glitchiness of manus.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/deanwball/status/1898777823059554652">https://x.com/deanwball/status/1898777823059554652</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-499.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-499">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/deanwball/status/1898777823059554652</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/deanwball/status/1898777823059554652</guid><pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 15:16:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[yup]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1864685699804614660/OLBR8Da7_200x200.png"></p><p>Alexander Doria (@Dorialexander) on X</p><p>Simultaneously, one of the funniest and saddest post this evening.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/Dorialexander/status/1898849260059164997">https://x.com/Dorialexander/status/1898849260059164997</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-499.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-499">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/Dorialexander/status/1898849260059164997</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/Dorialexander/status/1898849260059164997</guid><pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 15:16:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[double yup]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1304437492037419008/uptcLrPW_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Derya Unutmaz, MD (@DeryaTR_) on X</p><p>After experiencing Manus AI, I’ve also revised my predictions for AGI arrival this year, increasing the probability from 90% to 95% by year’s end