e have done at Rotman, I am totally convinced the vast majority of research that doesn’t involve the physical world can be done more cheaply with AI &amp; a little human intervention than by even good researchers. 1/7</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/Afinetheorem/status/1898822592594874598">https://x.com/Afinetheorem/status/1898822592594874598</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-499.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-499">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/Afinetheorem/status/1898822592594874598</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/Afinetheorem/status/1898822592594874598</guid><pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 15:16:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[On the Douthat-Rufo dialogue]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1556851583362535424/tojkSjxa_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Hollis Robbins (@anecdotal) on X</p><p>I loved this conversation with @DouthatNYT and @realchrisrufo but only insiders will notice the many ways that both Douthat and Rufo are coming from outside higher ed, for better or worse, and have a limited understanding of how the modern university works. Neither questions why</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/anecdotal/status/1898883450930864201">https://x.com/anecdotal/status/1898883450930864201</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-499.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-499">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/anecdotal/status/1898883450930864201</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/anecdotal/status/1898883450930864201</guid><pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 15:16:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[“Cuteservatives”?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.semafor.com/article/03/09/2025/young-conservative-women-bu